{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai assisted ci pipeline authoring ai assisted ci pipeline authoring","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md","fileName":"AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-27 12:11\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[AI-Assisted DevOps Practice]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai assisted ci pipeline authoring ai assisted ci pipeline authoring","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md","fileName":"AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring","heading":"AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"AI-assisted pipeline authoring converts explicit repository context into a first-pass workflow. Useful context includes the application stack, solution path, triggers, runner, dependency cache, test commands, quality gates, and permission limits. The generated YAML should begin with a minimal [[Build Pipeline]] and exclude deployment unless deployment is intentionally in scope.\n\nThe draft must be checked for indentation, current action versions, command correctness, deterministic build settings, cache keys, concurrency, and least privilege. A workflow that looks plausible but has never run is not verified; the actual CI execution reveals assumptions about paths, tools, and project structure.","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"ai assisted ci pipeline authoring ai assisted ci pipeline authoring","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md","fileName":"AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"AI-Assisted CI Pipeline Authoring","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[agenticaifordevopsengineers.pdf]]","tags":[],"links":[],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}